接口 IPv6	2001:db8:10::2/64	2001:db8:10::3/64
Group	20	20
Virtual Link-Local	fe80::1	fe80::1
Virtual Global	2001:db8:10::1	2001:db8:10::1
Priority	120	100


R1
ipv6 unicast-routing
fhrp version vrrp v3
!
