 ipv6 address 2001:DB8:10::2/64
 vrrp 20 address-family ipv6
  address FE80::1 primary
  address 2001:DB8:10::1 secondary
  priority 120
  preempt delay minimum 30
  exit-vrrp
R2
ipv6 unicast-routing
fhrp version vrrp v3
!
